      <p class="hint">Click a point and drag, or tab to the canvas and use <b>1</b> <b>2</b> <b>3</b> to pick a point then the arrow keys to move it. Hold Shift for single-pixel steps.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- ================= RAIL ================= -->
